# The publish workflow's deploy key. Generating it leaves the pair in the repo
# root (see the setup notes at the top of .github/workflows/publish-student-copy.yml).
# It has never been committed and must not be: the private half is already
# installed as the STUDENT_REPO_DEPLOY_KEY secret, so the local copy is only a
# spare, and this repo publishes to a public one.
student_deploy_key
student_deploy_key.pub
*.pem
